<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal cuts deposit rate to 5.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal cuts deposit rate to 5.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Portugal said it cut its deposit rate on commercial bank reserves to 5.2 percent from 5.6 percent previously.</p>
<p>The rate, which the Bank sets every three months, was last cut in February when it was lowered from 6.3 percent.</p>
<p>The rate is the rate the Bank pays on obligatory commercial bank reserves.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
